{"id":2613,"date":"2025-07-28T08:00:00","date_gmt":"2025-07-28T13:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/?post_type=news&#038;p=2613"},"modified":"2025-07-28T06:23:03","modified_gmt":"2025-07-28T11:23:03","slug":"introducing-dreams-of-kingsport","status":"publish","type":"news","link":"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/news\/introducing-dreams-of-kingsport\/","title":{"rendered":"Introducing Dreams of Kingsport"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p><em>EDGE Studio offer a first look at a new setting guide for\u00a0<\/em>Arkham Horror RPG<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Dearest Dreamers,&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>It\u2019s Leah here, one of the game developers for Asmodee\u2019s Edge Studio. It is with an immense amount of excitement that I am here to announce more brand-new, delightfully supernatural&nbsp;<em>Arkham Horror<\/em>&nbsp;<em>RPG&nbsp;<\/em>content for you to add to your collection of esoteric tomes.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>But before that, let\u2019s do a quick recap on what we\u2019ve released (or announced) so far:&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong><em><a href=\"https:\/\/www.edge-studio.net\/why-an-arkham-horror-starter-set\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Starter Set \u2013 Hungering Abyss<\/a><\/em><\/strong>: a starter box filled with tons of material that acts as an entry point for players new to the\u00a0<em>Arkham Horror RPG<\/em>\u00a0and those who might be new to roleplaying games in general;\u00a0<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong><em><a href=\"https:\/\/www.edge-studio.net\/games\/arkham-horror-rpg-core-rulebook\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Arkham Horror RPG Core<\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/www.edge-studio.net\/games\/arkham-horror-rpg-core-rulebook\/\">\u00a0Rulebook<\/a><\/em><\/strong><em>:<\/em>\u00a0the foundational release that outlines the rules for the game, gives folks the ability to create their own investigators, and offers a ton of lore about the world of Arkham Horror;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong><em><a href=\"https:\/\/www.edge-studio.net\/introducing-arkham-mysteries\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Arkham Mysteries<\/a><\/em><\/strong>: a book containing three investigations set in and around the city of Arkham;\u00a0<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.edge-studio.net\/explore-the-unknown-with-terra-antarctica\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><em>Premium Adventure<\/em>\u00a0\u2013\u00a0<em>Terra Antarctica<\/em><\/a><\/strong>: an absolutely jam-packed campaign box filled with tons of terror beyond fathom.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edge-studio.net\/image-converter?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.svc.asmodee.net%2Fproduction-edge%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F07%2FESDPSAH05EN_Mockup_art01.png&amp;attachment_id=11390\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11390\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>And now it\u2019s time to cue the ominous drumming and cultish chanting as I introduce a brand-new product type: our first setting guide,&nbsp;<em>Dreams of Kingsport<\/em>!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Inside this 160-page hardcover book you\u2019ll find lore for both the iconic, mist-shrouded town of Kingsport, Massachusetts and the fabled and bizarre realm of the Dreamlands.&nbsp;In a series of future articles I\u2019ll give you a more detailed peek at each of the chapters of the book, but for now here are some of the highlights to whet your appetite for more&nbsp;<em>Arkham Horror<\/em>&nbsp;<em>RPG<\/em>&nbsp;content:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>A brand-new archetype for players to use: the\u00a0<strong>dreamer<\/strong>, an adept visionary who can find inspiration in even the most horrifying of moments. Includes an entire new roster of knacks for the dreamer to tap into.\u00a0<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>A dozen mini-mysteries to spark inspiration and give GMs a place to start when featuring many of the different locations introduced in the Kingsport and Dreamlands chapters.\u00a0<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>New equipment, relics, tomes, and the addition of ship profiles and guidance on sailing, whether at sea or in the skies!<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>The introduction of a new type of reward that investigators may encounter on their adventures\u2013<strong>favor<\/strong>, a mechanic that gives special perks for winning the approval of certain people and creatures.\u00a0<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Over a dozen new NPC profiles that include both classic\u00a0<em>Arkham Horror<\/em>\u00a0enemies and potential allies as well as all-new Dreamlands-inspired entities and creatures.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>A deeper look into two Ancient Ones mentioned in the\u00a0<em>Core Rulebook<\/em>, plus the inclusion of a new Other World and an Ancient One we haven\u2019t previously introduced into the RPG.\u00a0<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>An adventure,\u00a0<em>Dream Manifest<\/em>, that features both Kingsport and the Dreamlands, so GMs and players can dive right into the new setting materials!<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>One double-sided poster map and one smaller double-sided battlemap (the battlemap is included to enhance the included Dream Manifest adventure).\u00a0<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>So, in short, this book is&nbsp;<em>awesome<\/em>&nbsp;(in our opinion) and I\u2019m looking forward to giving you a closer look at it over the next several articles to really drive home how cool we think it is.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>That\u2019s all for now. Oh, and dreamers, don\u2019t forget to store your body somewhere safe when practicing astral projection! <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right\">\u2013Leah Hawthorne<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><em>Dreams of Kingsport<\/em>&nbsp;will be released in Q4 2025.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2614,"parent":0,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":true},"key-tag":[37,18],"class_list":["post-2613","news","type-news","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","key-tag-edge-studio","key-tag-rpgs"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast